    "Replaced pro 1 because the note 'The sidebar clearly groups CRM (Contacts, Lists, Segments) and Marketing (Campaigns, Statistics, Templates) plus Automations, so the areas the task needs were easy to locate' provides a more specific and positive aspect of the platform's structure and navigability than a general 'unified platform'.",
    "Replaced con 2 because the note 'The Campaigns listing page showed only a spinner for 15+ seconds across three observations and never rendered, so I could not start the welcome, feature-update or promo drafts' indicates a critical performance issue that directly impacts the ability to use core marketing features, which is a more severe and specific problem than general reporting limitations."
